You can use the Newtonsoft.Json library in C# to parse the JSON data and extract the required information. Here is an example code snippet that extracts the sub-continents and their respective countries:
```csharp
using Newtonsoft.Json;
using System;
using System.Collections.Generic;
namespace ConsoleApp1
{
    class Program
    {
