You can modify your code as follows to remove every other adjective and sort the remaining adjectives alphabetically:
```
$string = "This is a big, beautiful, red, shiny apple.";
$adjectives = preg_replace('/[^,]+(,|$)/', '', $string);
$adjectivesArray = explode(',', $adjectives);
$sortedAdjectives = array();
foreach ($adjectivesArray as $key => $adjective) {
  if ($key % 2 == 0) {
    continue;
  }
  $sortedAdjectives[] = trim($adjective);
}
sort($sortedAdjectives);
$finalString = str_replace($adjectives, implode(', ', $sortedAdjectives), $string);
echo $finalString;
